    "text": "<p>A light cylindrical vessel is kept on a horizontal surface. Area of the base is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo></math> A hole of cross-sectional area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;is made just at its bottom side. The minimum coefficient of friction necessary to prevent sliding the vessel due to the impact force of the emerging liquid is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ead106dd-1a60-4caf-918b-57c284ac3732-image.png\" style=\"width: 187px; height: 171px;\" /></p>",
